"Tap + on the Trans. tab. Pick Income, Expense or Transfer, then the amount, category and account. The keypad has a calculator (÷ × − +). Save closes the form; Continue keeps it open for the next entry. Swipe left or right on the Trans. tab to change month (or tab, in Configuration › Swipe).": "在账本标签页点按 +。选择收入、支出或转账，然后填写金额、分类和账户。键盘内置计算器（÷ × − +）。保存会关闭表单；继续则保持打开，方便录入下一条。在账本标签页向左或向右滑动可切换月份（或切换标签页，在 设置 › 滑动 中设定）。",
